Z_004 - It is demonstrated by the data collected that the spread of rubbish with the aim of controlling some people present in the area and affected by the presence of such waste causes in the long term the deterioration of work and human relationships to the point of not even allowing the creation of families or stable long-term working relationships. Therefore it is important that the authorities are vigilant in this regard and that there are no criminal phenomena of spreading rubbish for the purposes of controlling the territory or psychologically altering people. Billboards exist for those who need to spread content to the population, without mentioning all the other media. All waste other than the canonical bottles and cans, cigarette butts or cigarette cases are to be considered as explicit attempts to alter people's psychology. The following are some examples of such waste or tampering.
